extends ../../../../../../ux3/widgets/manage-alerts/templates/alerts/new-content-tmpl

block newContentAlertText
    p.intro-text To receive alerts when new content is published in the journals listed below, check the box next to each publication you select. Then indicate the alert frequency you would like and the e-mail format and click “Submit.” Note that if you subscribe to more than one alert, your frequency and format settings will apply to all of your alerts.
